[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitinstenvchild"]

; The WorldEnvironment for unit-instanced-environment.tscn, in its own scene so
; the parent can INSTANCE it. A WorldEnvironment one instance level down must
; still drive the scene's tonemap + ambient and yield the editor preview env.

